{"seq":1,"slug":"forward-reverse-geocoding-precision","title":"正向与反向地理编码及精度分级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/checkout-address-validation-geocoding-delivery-engine/geocoding-tax-delivery-decision/forward-reverse-geocoding-precision","wordCount":2569,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"正向与反向地理编码及精度分级\">正向与反向地理编码及精度分级</h1><p>跨境结账链路里，「地理编码」常被当成一个开关：拿到地址就调一次接口，拿到坐标就写进订单。真正的工程问题不是能不能编码，而是<strong>这次编码把投递点钉在了哪里</strong>——是屋顶，是一段插值出来的街道中线，还是一个城市质心？同一个 <code>lat/lng</code> 反向编码里可能同时对应三个层级的答案，选错一层，税区判定、配送分区、时效预估会各自错开一个行政单位。本文拆开两条路径，给出把各厂商精度标签收敛到同一条档位线的方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两条路径与一个坐标契约\">核心概念：两条路径与一个坐标契约</h2><p><strong>正向地理编码（forward geocoding）</strong> 把地址文本或结构化组件映射到坐标；<strong>反向地理编码（reverse geocoding）</strong> 把坐标映射回地址与行政层级。二者不对称：正向在地址条目上有确定性答案，反向则必须做<strong>最近邻搜索</strong>——Nominatim 的官方定义是「找到最近的合适 OSM 对象并返回其地址信息」，并警告密集城区最近对象可能属于<strong>另一条街</strong>（来源：nominatim.org release-docs）。因此反向编码天然带一个不可消除的<strong>归属歧义</strong>：返回的不一定是「你站的那栋楼」，而是「数据里离你最近、且适合被检索的那个对象」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;已提交地址&lt;br/&gt;文本或结构化组件&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;正向地理编码&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{&quot;匹配粒度&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;门牌命中&quot;| D[&quot;屋顶 / 地块点&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;区间插值&quot;| E[&quot;街道段插值点&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;仅到道路&quot;| F[&quot;道路/区域质心&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G[&quot;投递点坐标 WGS84&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;反向地理编码&lt;br/&gt;最近合适对象&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I{&quot;层级过滤&lt;br/&gt;layer / result_type&quot;}&#10;  I --&gt; J[&quot;行政层级栈&lt;br/&gt;国家→省→市→区&quot;]&#10;  J --&gt; K[&quot;税区 / 配送分区 / 时效&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; L[&quot;精度档位标注&quot;]&#10;  L --&gt; K\">graph TD\n  A[\"已提交地址&lt;br/&gt;文本或结构化组件\"] --&gt; B[\"正向地理编码\"]\n  B --&gt; C{\"匹配粒度\"}\n  C --&gt;|\"门牌命中\"| D[\"屋顶 / 地块点\"]\n  C --&gt;|\"区间插值\"| E[\"街道段插值点\"]\n  C --&gt;|\"仅到道路\"| F[\"道路/区域质心\"]\n  D --&gt; G[\"投递点坐标 WGS84\"]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[\"反向地理编码&lt;br/&gt;最近合适对象\"]\n  H --&gt; I{\"层级过滤&lt;br/&gt;layer / result_type\"}\n  I --&gt; J[\"行政层级栈&lt;br/&gt;国家→省→市→区\"]\n  J --&gt; K[\"税区 / 配送分区 / 时效\"]\n  G --&gt; L[\"精度档位标注\"]\n  L --&gt; K</pre><p>坐标契约是地基，三件事必须在设计期钉死。<strong>基准面</strong>：内部一律存 WGS84（EPSG:4326）十进制度，任何投影坐标入库前转换。<strong>小数位</strong>：经纬度存到小数点后 6–7 位（第 6 位约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.111</mn><mtext> m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.111\\ \\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.111</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>），更多位无意义。<strong>精度档位</strong>：坐标必须与档位标签同生共死地存储，否则下游无法判断它是可信的屋顶点还是兜底质心。两条路径共享同一个距离度量——跨境必须用大圆距离（haversine）而非平面欧氏距离，它同时决定反向编码的搜索半径与「两个候选算不算同一投递点」的阈值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>arcsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>φ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>φ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>φ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = 2R \\arcsin\\sqrt{\\sin^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\Delta\\varphi}{2}\\right) + \\cos\\varphi_1\\cos\\varphi_2\\,\\sin^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\Delta\\lambda}{2}\\right)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.04em;vertical-align:-1.1561em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">arcsin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8839em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8719em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1208em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8719em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1208em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8439em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:3.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3240\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M473,2793\nc339.3,-1799.3,509.3,-2700,510,-2702 l0 -0\nc3.3,-7.3,9.3,-11,18,-11 H400000v40H1017.7\ns-90.5,478,-276.2,1466c-185.7,988,-279.5,1483,-281.5,1485c-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2c0,-1.3,-5.3,-32,-16,-92c-50.7,-293.3,-119.7,-693.3,-207,-1200\nc0,-1.3,-5.3,8.7,-16,30c-10.7,21.3,-21.3,42.7,-32,64s-16,33,-16,33s-26,-26,-26,-26\ns76,-153,76,-153s77,-151,77,-151c0.7,0.7,35.7,202,105,604c67.3,400.7,102,602.7,104,\n606zM1001 80h400000v40H1017.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1561em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 取 6371008.8 m，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span></span> 为纬度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 为经度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>正向地理编码</th>\n<th>反向地理编码</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入</td>\n<td>地址串 / 结构化组件</td>\n<td>坐标 <code>lat,lng</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出</td>\n<td>少量坐标 + 匹配粒度</td>\n<td>多个层级结果，最具体在前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确定性</td>\n<td>高（命中有/无）</td>\n<td>低（最近邻，归属歧义）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键参数</td>\n<td>组件偏置、语言、区域</td>\n<td>搜索半径、<code>zoom</code>/<code>result_type</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精度标签</td>\n<td><code>location_type</code> / <code>match_code</code></td>\n<td>同上，有时缺 <code>confidence</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"正向地理编码-从地址串到坐标\">正向地理编码：从地址串到坐标</h2><p>第一道分叉是<strong>结构化 vs 自由文本</strong>。结构化请求把 <code>house_number</code>、<code>route</code>、<code>locality</code>、<code>postal_code</code>、<code>country</code> 分字段传入，厂商可逐字段校验并做组件偏置（component bias），命中率与可解释性都远高于整串自由文本。自由文本必须先进解析与归一化——正是地址数据模型章节讨论的元素拆分与音译标准化的用武之地（见同 hub <a href=\"../address-data-model-international-format/address-component-model-administrative-hierarchy\">地址组成元素模型与行政层级抽象</a>）。应优先走结构化路径，仅在用户粘贴整串地址时退回解析。</p>\n<p>第二道分叉是<strong>匹配粒度</strong>。Google Geocoding 用 <code>location_type</code> 表达层级（来源：developers.google.com/maps/documentation/geocoding/requests-geocoding）：<code>ROOFTOP</code> 精确到门牌的建筑点；<code>RANGE_INTERPOLATED</code> 由两个精确定点（通常是路口）之间沿道路插值得到，只能落到街道段；<code>GEOMETRIC_CENTER</code> 是折线或多边形的几何中心；<code>APPROXIMATE</code> 是笼统近似点。同页的 <code>partial_match</code> 在编码器只匹配上请求的一部分时置位——目标街道不存在、拼写错误触发纠正建议、或同时命中两条相似街道都可能发生。<strong><code>partial_match</code> 是留给风控与结账前确认的关键信号</strong>：置位时不能静默接受。Mapbox Search v6 提供更细的可解释性：<code>match_code</code> 把每个组件标为 <code>matched</code>/<code>unmatched</code>/<code>inferred</code>/<code>plausible</code>，整体 <code>confidence</code> 为 <code>exact</code>/<code>high</code>/<code>medium</code>/<code>low</code>，<code>coordinates.accuracy</code> 取 <code>rooftop</code>、<code>parcel</code>、<code>point</code>、<code>interpolated</code>、<code>approximate</code>（来源：docs.mapbox.com/api/search/geocoding/）。其中 <code>inferred</code> 表示组件是<strong>推断补全</strong>而非用户输入。一条纪律：<strong>返回带置信度而非单点</strong>——只取排序第一条等于把「哪条才是用户想要的」交给了厂商默认排序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反向地理编码-最近邻-层级过滤与归属歧义\">反向地理编码：最近邻、层级过滤与归属歧义</h2><p>反向编码的本质是「以坐标为圆心做半径查询，再按层级返回」。Google 反向编码在容差内找不到可寻址位置时返回 <code>ZERO_RESULTS</code>，结果通常是<strong>多个</strong>——精确地址、建筑、道路、街区、邮编、城市、行政区、国家的叠加，最具体的排在前面。结果可用 <code>result_type</code> 过滤，官方明确这是<strong>后置过滤</strong>：先找出附近全部结果再丢弃不匹配的（来源：developers.google.com/maps/documentation/geocoding/requests-reverse-geocoding）——过滤不减少查询成本，只影响返回集。Nominatim 用等价旋钮：<code>zoom</code> 0–18 决定详细程度（3 约为国家、18 约为建筑），<code>layer</code> 可限定只返回 <code>address</code> 或 <code>poi</code>（来源：nominatim.org release-docs）。结论一致：<strong>调用方必须显式声明需要哪一层答案</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反向输出层级</th>\n<th>典型 <code>result_type</code></th>\n<th>结账用途</th>\n<th>归属歧义风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>建筑/单元</td>\n<td><code>premise</code> / <code>subpremise</code></td>\n<td>投递点确认</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门牌号</td>\n<td><code>street_address</code></td>\n<td>地址回填</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>道路</td>\n<td><code>route</code> / <code>intersection</code></td>\n<td>兜底定位</td>\n<td>中（长路段跨区）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>城市/邮区</td>\n<td><code>locality</code> / <code>postal_code</code></td>\n<td>税区、时效</td>\n<td>高（跨市跨州）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行政区域</td>\n<td><code>administrative_area_level_1..7</code></td>\n<td>合规、税制</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>归属歧义的处理有一条实用规则：<strong>搜索半径应与精度档位挂钩</strong>。先设较小半径（如 100 m）尝试命中 <code>premise</code>/<code>street_address</code>，未命中再逐级放大到 500 m、2 km，并在档位上如实记录。若一次放大后跨越行政区边界（例如省市不一致），应标为<strong>冲突</strong>而非直接采用——这正是结账时「地址与定位不符，请确认」提示的来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精度分级体系-把各厂商标签收敛到一条档位线\">精度分级体系：把各厂商标签收敛到一条档位线</h2><p>各家精度标签名字与粒度都不同，直接比较会把工程拖入厂商绑定。可行做法是定义内部档位，为每个厂商写映射函数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内部档位</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>Google <code>location_type</code></th>\n<th>Google Address Validation</th>\n<th>Mapbox <code>accuracy</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L0 单元级</td>\n<td>单元/公寓</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><code>SUB_PREMISE</code></td>\n<td><code>rooftop</code>（含单元点）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1 建筑级</td>\n<td>单栋建筑</td>\n<td><code>ROOFTOP</code></td>\n<td><code>PREMISE</code></td>\n<td><code>rooftop</code> / <code>parcel</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 邻近级</td>\n<td>建筑邻近点位</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><code>PREMISE_PROXIMITY</code></td>\n<td><code>point</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 街区级</td>\n<td>街区（日本等区划）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><code>BLOCK</code></td>\n<td><code>interpolated</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 街道级</td>\n<td>街道插值</td>\n<td><code>RANGE_INTERPOLATED</code></td>\n<td><code>ROUTE</code></td>\n<td><code>interpolated</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L5 区域级</td>\n<td>折线/多边形中心</td>\n<td><code>GEOMETRIC_CENTER</code></td>\n<td><code>OTHER</code></td>\n<td><code>approximate</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L6 兜底级</td>\n<td>城市/邮编质心</td>\n<td><code>APPROXIMATE</code></td>\n<td><code>OTHER</code></td>\n<td><code>approximate</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Google Address Validation 把「能不能确认」和「能不能定位」拆成两个字段：<code>validationGranularity</code>（能<strong>完整验证</strong>到的层级）与 <code>geocodeGranularity</code>（返回坐标的<strong>语义精度</strong>），两者取值同为 <code>SUB_PREMISE</code>/<code>PREMISE</code>/<code>PREMISE_PROXIMITY</code>/<code>BLOCK</code>/<code>ROUTE</code>/<code>OTHER</code>（来源：developers.google.com/maps/documentation/address-validation/reference/rest/v1/TopLevel/validateAddress）。官方典型差异：一间公寓能验证到 <code>SUB_PREMISE</code>，但精确坐标只算到 <code>PREMISE</code>（来源：developers.google.com/maps/documentation/address-validation/understand-response）。<strong>映射内部档位时应取两者中较弱者作为「坐标档位」</strong>——下游关心坐标能钉多准，而非语义上确认到哪一层。同响应的 <code>possibleNextAction</code>（<code>FIX</code>/<code>CONFIRM_ADD_SUBPREMISES</code>/<code>CONFIRM</code>/<code>ACCEPT</code>）与 <code>hasInferredComponents</code>、<code>addressComplete</code> 共同构成决策依据，结账应以 <code>possibleNextAction</code> 为主分支。</p>\n<p>把「静默接受」严格限制在 L1 及更细，是跨境税区与配送分区不出系统性偏差的底线：坐标档位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>coord</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>map</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>map</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_{\\text{coord}} = \\min(\\text{map}(v), \\text{map}(c))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">coord</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">map</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">map</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g \\le L1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 静默接受、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>L</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L2 \\le g \\le L3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 提示复核、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>L</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g \\ge L4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 要求补全。参照同章 <a href=\"tax-jurisdiction-nexus-determination\">税区与管辖区判定</a>，用邮编质心直接查税率会让同一 ZIP 内税额差 1–3 个百分点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精度之外-坐标系统偏移与插值误差\">精度之外：坐标系统偏移与插值误差</h2><p>有两类误差不体现在任何厂商的精度标签里，却能在跨境场景造成实打实的错位。</p>\n<p>第一类是<strong>基准面偏移</strong>。中国大陆的地图服务普遍使用 GCJ-02（俗称「火星坐标」），百度进一步加密为 BD-09；GPS、国际数据源与 WGS84 是另一套。同一栋楼在 GCJ-02 与 WGS84 下的直线差通常在<strong>数百米量级</strong>，足以把投递点挪到相邻街区。规则只有一条：<strong>在系统边界做一次性转换，进入核心域之前全部归一到 WGS84</strong>，绝不允许两种基准面混存。反向编码若用境内厂商结果去匹配境外税区数据，错位会被放大——这类 bug 表现为「少量地址税区诡异偏移」，排查成本极高。</p>\n<p>第二类是<strong>插值误差</strong>。<code>RANGE_INTERPOLATED</code> 的点沿街段线性插值：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x = x_0 + \\frac{n - n_0}{n_1 - n_0}(x_1 - x_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2635em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8184em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是目标门牌、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_0, n_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是街段两端门牌号。该模型假设<strong>门牌沿街道均匀分布</strong>，而现实中门牌常按地块宽度非线性跳号，误差随街段长度放大——一条 800 m 的街段，插值点离真实建筑可能差出上百米。<strong>跨辖区的长街段是重灾区</strong>：街道两侧分属不同城市或税收特别区时，插值落在哪一侧直接决定税率。</p>\n<p>对<strong>无门牌地址</strong>（大量新兴市场与农村场景），补充手段是网格码：Open Location Code（Plus Codes）10 位字符约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn><mtext> m</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>14</mn><mtext> m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14\\ \\text{m} \\times 14\\ \\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>、11 位约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.5</mn><mtext> m</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>2.8</mn><mtext> m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.5\\ \\text{m} \\times 2.8\\ \\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.8</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>，短码需借助参考地点在约 40 km 内恢复（来源：Open Location Code 规范）；what3words 则把地球切成 3 m × 3 m 方格。两者都是<strong>投递点标识符</strong>而非行政地址，不能替代行政层级判定。调用上还有三条纪律：缓存键含精度语义（归一化输入 + 区域/语言 + 请求层级）；降级到备用厂商后必须<strong>重新分档</strong>，兜底只到 L4/L5 时改走「提示复核」；把 <code>provider</code>、<code>granularity</code>、<code>partial_match</code>、<code>latency</code> 写入可观测性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>正向与反向不对称：前者是有无命中，后者是最近邻搜索，天然带归属歧义，密集城区可能返回邻街对象。</li>\n<li>精度不是布尔量：内部定义七档模型（L0 单元级 → L6 兜底级），为每个厂商写映射函数，下游只认内部档位。</li>\n<li>坐标档位取 <code>validationGranularity</code> 与 <code>geocodeGranularity</code> 中<strong>较弱者</strong>；结账主分支跟随厂商的 <code>possibleNextAction</code>。</li>\n<li><code>partial_match</code> 与 <code>hasInferredComponents</code> 是必须单独监听的风险信号——置位时不能静默接受。</li>\n<li>GCJ-02/BD-09 偏移与街道插值误差不体现在精度标签里，却常是跨境税区偏差的根因。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"正向与反向地理编码及精度分级","id":"正向与反向地理编码及精度分级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两条路径与一个坐标契约","id":"核心概念-两条路径与一个坐标契约"},{"level":2,"text":"正向地理编码：从地址串到坐标","id":"正向地理编码-从地址串到坐标"},{"level":2,"text":"反向地理编码：最近邻、层级过滤与归属歧义","id":"反向地理编码-最近邻-层级过滤与归属歧义"},{"level":2,"text":"精度分级体系：把各厂商标签收敛到一条档位线","id":"精度分级体系-把各厂商标签收敛到一条档位线"},{"level":2,"text":"精度之外：坐标系统偏移与插值误差","id":"精度之外-坐标系统偏移与插值误差"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"投递点类型识别与可达性验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/checkout-address-validation-geocoding-delivery-engine/validation-autocomplete-delivery-point/delivery-point-type-locker-pickup-validation"},"next":{"title":"税区与管辖区判定（含 Nexus 归属）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/checkout-address-validation-geocoding-delivery-engine/geocoding-tax-delivery-decision/tax-jurisdiction-nexus-determination"}}